<div class="callout-dark">
<h4 class="callout-dark__title">Federal Procurement Compliance</h4>
<p class="callout-dark__body">The Buy American Act (BAA) requires federal agencies to purchase domestically manufactured products for direct procurement above the micro-purchase threshold. The Trade Agreements Act (TAA) extends eligibility to products from designated trade partner countries. ALG products meet both standards, simplifying procurement for contracting officers and eliminating compliance risk for contractors bidding government projects. Our products are eligible for GSA Schedule and GSA Advantage listing.</p>
